      "side": 1,
      "message": "This comparison is the same than comparing the packIds inside a.compareTo(b) because in JGit the preferred pack is always the first in the list.\n\nDelete the extra comparison and add a comment explaining this (\"// No need to check preferred pack because in JGit it is the first in the list\").\n\nSo far there has been no need to implement a \"use an arbitrary pack as preferred\", but if one day we do it, we must readd this check.",
