      "writtenOn": "2026-11-24T22:17:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed for the ordering JGit’s writer produces. The reader also accepts MIDX files whose reverse index places a higher-ID preferred pack first. Ordinary pack-ID comparison can miss valid entries in that order.\n\nI’ve therefore kept preferred-pack ordering only in the full-RIDX fallback. The BTMP-bounded search uses the ordinary comparison.",
